                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I grew up right down the road from my great-grandparents' family farm in Nashua \u2013 I know how important New Hampshire\u2019s farms are to the health of our communities and economy. \n\nHad a fantastic morning with local organic farmers from Weare, New Boston, Hillsborough, Nelson, Chichester, and Concord. We covered a lot of ground \u2014 from the critical role federal programs play in their work to the ways we can rein in the power of Big Ag in America. I\u2019m proud to fight for New Hampshire\u2019s incredible and resilient farmers in Congress and on the House Small Business Committee.",
                "text_lang": "en",
