                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The System Operators of @IBEW1837 work around the clock to bring power to people across New Hampshire.  \n\nThe work they do is hard and mission-critical. The electric grids they are entrusted with operating are absolutely vital to the health, safety, and economic security of people across New Hampshire. \n\n@EversourceNH: It\u2019s time to bargain in good faith and deliver a fair contract!",
