                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "You and your family deserve access to high-quality, affordable healthcare, regardless of where you live. \n\nThis morning in Lebanon, I met with the students who are the future of rural medicine \u2014 I left our conversations inspired by their determination and hopeful for the future we can build, together.",
