                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Life comes at you fast. And it\u2019s not right that working people across New Hampshire are living one medical emergency away from bankruptcy, homelessness, or worse.\n\nIn Congress, I\u2019m working to build an economy that works for hardworking people. That's why I am proud to help introduce commonsense legislation, guaranteeing paid family and medical leave.",
