                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We are living through the most brutal and relentless attack on New Hampshire\u2019s community health centers in American history. Republican healthcare cuts are the biggest, most ruthless in history, and their impacts are not hypothetical. The pain and devastation are real for patients, providers, and places like @LampreyHealth in Nashua. \n\nImportant conversation yesterday about how gutting healthcare is raising your already sky-high costs and forcing hardworking Americans to make impossible choices that no person should have to make. \n\nI will not give up in the fight for your healthcare.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
