                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Throughout my lifetime, Tess Kuenning has been a tireless champion for the health of the people of New Hampshire. And because of Tess, Bi-State is a lifeline for people across New Hampshire.\n\nWe are in the midst of the most brutal and relentless assault on New Hampshire\u2019s community health centers in American history. In these dark and difficult days, I am grateful every day for Tess Kuenning.\n\nTess: thank you from the bottom of my heart for your 30 years at the helm. New Hampshire is healthier and stronger because of you, and I am proud and grateful to be working alongside you today and in the days ahead.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
