                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "New Hampshire\u2019s public schools are paying the price for our broken healthcare system and the GOP\u2019s historic cuts to it. \n\nI\u2019m working with every tool I\u2019ve got to fix our broken system, protect your care, and lower your costs.\nhttps://t.co/b5b7BxJCsh",
