                "text": "The mental health crisis and opioid epidemic have touched the lives of our kids in every community across New Hampshire and America. It\u2019s going to take all of us working together to end this cycle and save lives.\u00a0\n\nYesterday in Plymouth, the amazing team at @CADY4Youth brought our community together around that vital mission, which I\u2019m proud to help champion in Congress.",
