                "text": "American patriots are paying the price for the GOP\u2019s historic tax breaks for billionaires and big corporations. 267,000 veterans across America will lose their health coverage because of the GOP\u2019s Big, Brutal Budget.\n\nUnacceptable. https://t.co/Pw9ghJbQjW",
