                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I kicked off a busy day today in Keene at Monadnock Family Services \u2014 an amazing community health center where life-saving and life-changing care has been delivered to people across the Monadnock Region since 1905.\n\nI left my visit motivated by what I heard and learned from a truly hardworking group of New Hampshire patients and providers: the costs and pain of the GOP\u2019s cuts to healthcare are real. I will never quit working to protect your healthcare.",
