                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I was raised by a family of New Hampshire family farmers, and I believe deep in my bones that our farmers are the beating heart of the health and economy of communities across our state. I\u2019ve learned a lot from Scott and Heidi Mason, and I loved starting my day with them today in Stratford at Northwinds Farm. They embody the best of the Farm Free or Die spirit that we need in America today to ensure our family farmers can thrive for generations to come.",
